The `rank` of each verb is derived from FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave
(https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, content/2018/es/es_50k.txt),
whose word lists are licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Only the rank number of each
infinitive's word form is used; this directory is treated as an adaptation
and is shared under the same license.
